Revision history for Net-Connection

0.3.0   2026-07-28:23:30
        - Add the pid_start method.
        - Resolve port names using the connection protocol instead of always tcp.
        - Fix PTR resolution and share a single Net::DNS::Resolver between objects.
        - Die if uid_resolve is true but neither uid or username is defined.

0.2.0   2019-07-12/05:40
        - Add support for proc, pctmem, pctcpu, and wchan.

0.1.0   2019-07-28/21:45
        - Add the pid method.
        - Resolve ports when the port is numeric.

0.0.0   2019-07-06/23:00
        -Initial release.


